 #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>The fire is animated much like <a href=\"/page/Item:Crown_of_Fire\" title=\"Item:Crown of Fire\">Crown of Fire</a> (which can be traded for this). It looks like a <a href=\"/page/Monster_Champion\" title=\"Monster Champion\">Monster Champion</a> crown.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://content.turbine.com/sites/edm/ddo/cmty/fire_crownv2.gif\">Fiery animation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Available during <a href=\"/page/Bonus_Days\" title=\"Bonus Days\">Champion Hunter week</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817180109\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3135/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18449/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4164/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n132.03%  128.604     36 Template:IO\n100.00%   97.403      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   97.403      1 -total\n 93.12%   90.701      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 44.48%   43.327      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 43.64%   42.502      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.68%   41.569      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 41.69%   40.609      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.39%   16.941      1 Template:Mat\n 15.86%   15.446      2 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:51110-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817180109 and revision id 629467. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
